B.adQ=s(["Responsible for this app: PaulFV.\nContact: via GitHub \u2013 https://github.com/PaulFV"],t.s)
B.a8h=new A.fm("1. Controller",B.adQ)
B.a9Y=s(["All entries (passwords, credit cards, documents, notes, 2FA keys, folders, attachments) are stored locally on your device and encrypted with AES-256-GCM. The key is derived from your master password (Argon2id or PBKDF2) and never leaves your device.","PaulFV has no access to your data and can neither view nor recover it. No content is transmitted to PaulFV or third parties."],t.s)
B.a8p=new A.fm("2. Principle: your data stays with you",B.a9Y)
B.a91=s(["G04Passwort uses no analytics or tracking services, no advertising networks, no crash reporting services and no tracking cookies. Fonts and program code are part of the app and are not loaded from third-party servers (e.g. Google Fonts)."],t.s)
B.a8q=new A.fm("3. No analytics, no tracking, no advertising",B.a91)
B.ac0=s(["Android/iOS/desktop: encrypted SQLite database in the app storage and the keychain (Keychain/Keystore) for settings and \u2013 only if you enable it \u2013 the key for biometric unlock.","Web app: encrypted database in your browser storage (IndexedDB) and local browser storage for settings. This data is only required for the app to work (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR and \xa7 25(2) no. 2 TDDDG) and never leaves the browser."],t.s)
B.a8j=new A.fm("4. Local storage",B.ac0)
B.adJ=s(["The web app is provided via GitHub Pages (GitHub Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA; a subsidiary of Microsoft Corporation). When the page is accessed, GitHub processes technically necessary connection data such as IP address, time and browser information in server logs to deliver and secure the page (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Your vault contents are not transmitted.","The transfer to the USA is based on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework. Details: https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement","The Android test version is downloaded via GitHub Releases; the same applies there."],t.s)
B.a8A=new A.fm("5. Hosting of the web app (GitHub Pages)",B.adJ)
B.a90=s(["Fingerprint and Face ID are verified by the operating system. The app only receives the information \u201csuccessful\u201d or \u201cnot successful\u201d \u2013 never biometric data.","Web app: Face ID or fingerprint is used via a passkey (WebAuthn). The passkey is stored in your device keychain (e.g. iCloud Keychain or Google Password Manager) and may be synchronised between your own devices. After a successful check it only provides a secret value with which the app encrypts the vault key locally. Nothing is transmitted to PaulFV or any server. You can delete the passkey at any time in your device password settings.","Copied passwords are automatically removed from the clipboard after the configured time. Screenshot protection prevents content from appearing in screenshots or the app switcher."],t.s)
B.a8w=new A.fm("6. Biometrics, clipboard, screen",B.a90)
B.ac3=s(["Backups (.g04vault), CSV import and export as well as document attachments are only read or saved locally on your explicit command. An encrypted backup can only be opened with your master password. A CSV export is not encrypted \u2013 keep it safe and delete it after use."],t.s)
B.a8r=new A.fm("7. Files, backup and import",B.ac3)
B.aay=s(["Cloud synchronisation (e.g. Google Drive, OneDrive, iCloud, WebDAV) and a breach check are prepared but not yet active. They will only be used after you explicitly enable them; only encrypted data would be transmitted. This policy will be updated beforehand."],t.s)
B.a8o=new A.fm("8. Planned features",B.aay)
B.aab=s(["You can delete all data yourself at any time: Settings \u2192 \u201cReset vault\u201d, uninstall the app, or delete the website data of your browser for the web app."],t.s)
B.a8i=new A.fm("9. Deleting your data",B.aab)
B.abU=s(["Under the GDPR you have the right of access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection, as well as the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority. As PaulFV does not store any personal data about you, all data is solely in your hands. For data in GitHub server logs, please contact GitHub."],t.s)
B.a8l=new A.fm("10. Your rights",B.abU)
